        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Mwanace Jwangondolo jwamatukwile cimatilo ca mcece. Myoyo napikene ca umi ca mcece cila cili mkuŵeceta kuti, “Myice!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pinalolite, najiweni haci jakubiliŵita. Juŵakwesilepo lina lyakwe lyaliji ciwa, soni malo ga ŵandu ŵawe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " gamkuyaga panyuma. Ŵaŵiliwo ŵapegwile ulamusi pa mbali jimo ja mbali mcece sya cilambo capasi, kuti awulaje ŵandu kupitila mukutenda ngondo, cilala, yilwele, ni yilombo yaukali ya mwitinji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
