        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko ayimwene ŵa pa cilambo capasi, ŵakulamulila ŵa yilambo, acakulungwa ŵa ngondo, ŵandu ŵakusicila, ŵandu ŵamacili, ni jwalijose, acikapolo ni alukosyo ŵajile kukuŵa mu mbanga ni pasi pa malwala gekulungwa ga m'matumbi.",
